    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 08:45:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎订阅关注《沙发时间》，本期分享一些近期看到的纳粹与二战题材的作品，收听愉快～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 分享近期观看的二战题材书籍与电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a>《绝望者日记》：一个普通人眼中的纳粹德国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a>《文学之冬》与《巴黎烧了吗？》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 电影《外交秘闻》：巴黎得以幸存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 电影《纽伦堡》：审判、人性与恶的反思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">25:33</a> 电影《真理与背叛》：真人真事改编，文学与友情催生的微弱反抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">31:27</a> 人性是一个选项，而非天然善恶</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Part of Me Died》- Roger Waters</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Wait for Her》- Roger Waters</span></p>]]></description>
